{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9376bd3fc6e77ab5dec9e78bff5fe59bdad2f3be6ceb7e3db08653dc07fb81cb", "ja": "お疲れさま、朋花。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？　問題ないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花。\n新衣服怎么样？没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "e13611e767e4113244c5b86e37391747b715f5242424d95ee38fcc26f201eef5", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nええ。とてもステキな衣装で、満足していますよ～。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n嗯。这套服装非常漂亮，我很满意哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "2667455d2c18278aa80d65038d89c03f316598933c697e3dcc4d1235f47d8f32", "ja": "ところで、{$P$}さんに\n聞きたいことがあるのですが……。", "zh": "话说，我有件事想问问{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "721b519498b88ca2e2180d4017659d4d0a6637605c9896ec3f9b535be5f891c7", "ja": "どうして{$P$}さんは、\n私にこの衣装を着せようと思ったんですか～？", "zh": "为什么{$P$}先生会想让我穿上这套服装呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a2e80a1754f0c24729c83189b6aace07e569cb23edd429c9d001f887488d0093", "ja": "どうして……と言われると、これ！という明確な\n答えはないけど。朋花の曲のイメージで考えたかな。", "zh": "要问为什么……我也没有一个明确的答案，不过，是根据朋花歌曲的形象考虑的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e43fd3aeb425aefe0a1da39c7960fe5dcd7dfb05fbf68780bade39956410c26f", "ja": "あっ。もしかして、気に入らないのか？", "zh": "啊。难道说，你不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "97e583796b7ec1aa2ffd4563d55907715bc770d193f7e0a193baba2d035956c1", "ja": "気に入らないとは、言っていませんよ～？　ですが、\n私の曲のイメージという答えは、予想外でしたね～。", "zh": "我可没说不喜欢哦～？不过，把我的歌曲形象作为答案，确实出乎意料呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "7b83c4203bea182ba0c7850a2cc341f09c5992c7200b7b17c1872d04d9617fec", "ja": "私は、聖母ですよ～？\n聖母のイメージなら、衣装は白だと思うのですが～。", "zh": "我可是圣母哦～？\n既然是圣母的形象，我觉得服装应该是白色的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1008_p", "source_sha256": "13c3ee1360674175b259b6ac1c9b154b850ca03de014b8ba7c15ffaa9ec24ef0", "ja": "白……は、朋花の曲のイメージとは違うような……。\nいや、トラップなら、むしろ白もありなのか……？", "zh": "白色……好像和朋花歌曲的形象不太一样……  \n不，既然是陷阱的话，反而也可以用白色吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "4645374ab325f7d9174d4d620876e6b85ed0ead3f24fb264fc0fbc4d0fbb15eb", "ja": "そうですね～。もし私が罠を仕掛ける側であれば、\n黒では、怪しまれてしまうのではないでしょうか～？", "zh": "是啊～要是由我来设下陷阱的话，用黑色不是会引起怀疑吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "2da288e5f87a5cc70d970aa57b11e6f84b22fe2fee5f152e9ae9898fc4403d9a", "ja": "そんなことにも気づかないなんて、\n{$P$}さんも、まだまだですね～。", "zh": "连这种事都没察觉到，{$P$}先生也还差得远呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b767bcdbc7caa6ec8ae8ac4e96094bd6789e915c85fc39290a53f2e2b5257b8b", "ja": "はは、そうだな。でも朋花なら、\nそんな風に罠を仕掛けなくても十分というか……。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。不过要是朋花的话，就算不那样设下陷阱也完全够了，或者说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1012_p", "source_sha256": "44178d582f348ff7b3620016033025188d820b9c444d9c6c86660bd58940547c", "ja": "自分自身の魅力で真っ直ぐに惹きつけて、\nその上で、相手を翻弄する……という気が……。", "zh": "我感觉会先用自身的魅力直接吸引对方，然后再把对方玩弄于股掌之间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "966294d0da4443e79d0b305a6aec2bd0ea433cdfa87e48c678fd1ca509740ede", "ja": "うふふ……{$P$}さんは、\n私を、なんだと思っているのですか～？", "zh": "呵呵……{$P$}先生，\n把我看成什么样的人了呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a19798b576c2c2918c347d902ae6d564094c74bb8c60d00c569018bc6ea370ec", "ja": "あっ、す、すまない……。", "zh": "啊，不、不是……抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "d6b6f2b1064877f150ab2f3fc0548c99cdbbfa270d4367c0f3310eacb8521d58", "ja": "仕方ありませんね～。この衣装に免じて、\n今日のところは許してあげましょう～。", "zh": "没办法呢～看在这身服装的份上，今天就原谅你吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "1419dad0bb8f3704354fb11b6e97d9d8e00305c89a9d18e5c08dc1861308c8a4", "ja": "その代わり……私がこの衣装で、たくさんのお仕事が\nできるように。身を粉にして、働いてもらいますよ～？", "zh": "作为交换……为了让我能穿着这身服装，接到更多工作，你可要不惜一切地努力工作哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6ec9fbe560e90043bb0b00964d229c754c22db41783dc674dfb7f1b5292ef357", "ja": "ああ、それはもちろん。\nたくさん仕事を取ってくるから、期待しててくれ！", "zh": "啊，那是当然。\n我会接下很多工作的，尽管期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "1e33fb6f0ac938facac4b557f78e072a89e4833b4d88c15b49e1cc205277d324", "ja": "それなら結構です～。{$P$}さんの\n成果、楽しみにしていますよ～？", "zh": "那就好～。我很期待{$P$}先生的成果哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0184_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "0091c8689087856cb395ace9a721527fa3324c98306cc462699126f659bab214", "ja": "衣装はもちろんですが、私自身の魅力で、大勢の\n子豚ちゃんを惹きつけてみせますからね～。ふふっ♪", "zh": "不只是衣装，我还要用自身的魅力，\n将众多小猪崽们统统迷住哦～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
